{"seq": 242, "t_ms": 22266, "type": "verification", "data": {"citations_total": 25, "citations_valid": 25, "numbers_checked": 83, "numbers_traced": 75, "untraced": [{"number": "05:00", "text": "The best maintenance window in the Bolzano area is early morning, 05:00-07:00 local time, on Tuesday to Friday, with Thursday the strongest candidate."}, {"number": "07:00", "text": "The best maintenance window in the Bolzano area is early morning, 05:00-07:00 local time, on Tuesday to Friday, with Thursday the strongest candidate."}, {"number": "08:00", "text": "- Usage rises sharply after 07:00: Wed is 41.2% at 07:00 and 63.6% at 08:00, and Thu is 66.1% at 08:00 [E2]."}, {"number": "08:00", "text": "- Usage rises sharply after 07:00: Wed is 41.2% at 07:00 and 63.6% at 08:00, and Thu is 66.1% at 08:00 [E2]."}, {"number": "08:00", "text": "- Weekday daytime from 08:00 to 19:00 mostly runs at roughly 37-66%, so daytime work would affect more users [E2]."}, {"number": "19:00", "text": "- Weekday daytime from 08:00 to 19:00 mostly runs at roughly 37-66%, so daytime work would affect more users [E2]."}, {"number": "07:00", "text": "For BZ_C_RISPARMIO_01 and BZ_P_VITTORIA, whose peak is 08:00, the early window should work well, but finish by 07:00 [E3]."}, {"number": "00 may", "text": "- Null night cells mean unknown, not zero. Some 0.0 values at 00:00-05:00 may reflect little observable data, so a night window is not proven quiet [E2]."}], "unknown_ids": []}}
{"seq": 243, "t_ms": 25898, "type": "review_note", "data": {"text": "- **Key caveat:** The 6.6% Thursday figure rests on 5 dates, and early-morning occupancy may be understated because null or 0.0 night cells mean \"no data\", not \"quiet\". Confirm with per-site data before committing.\n- **Untraced:** The citation check flagged only time-of-day labels (05:00, 07:00, 08:00, 19:00) and a \"00 may\" parsing artifact. No occupancy value is untraced.\n- **Unsupported:** the \"37-66%\" daytime range is a summary, so verify it against the profile."}}
